X-WR-CALDESC:4 times a year, spread over 2 weeks: one task a day in place 
 of the zone. Default time: 6:30 PM, Monday to Friday (monthly and seasonal
  tasks sit inside that block at 6:35 PM). Move it to any time that suits y
 ou: open an event, tap Edit, change the time, then choose 'Save for Future
  Events' (iPhone) or 'This and following events' (Google). Safety: test an
 y hack on a small hidden spot first, never mix bleach with vinegar or ammo
 nia, and keep vinegar and lemon off natural stone. Full safety notes are o
 n page 3 of your guide. CelestialPrintCanada
